window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Get ready for Darby’s next adventure that will have you clinging to the edge of your seat.</p> <p><b><i>Dead &amp; Buried</i></b><b> is the seventh book in the Grave Talker Series. If you enjoy foul-mouthed heroines, dark humor, and enemies-to-lovers, then this is the series for you.</b></p> <p><i>For other books in this universe, listen to the steamy Soul Reader series.</i></p>"; 
